    "title": "Expect lane closures during Harbor Bridge exit construction - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 hours ago CORPUS CHRISTI, Texas — The new Harbor Bridge may be open and in use, but construction crews are still at work on a key piece of the project. Workers this week focused on completing the northbound U.S. 181 exit to North Beach. Drivers in the area are advised to use caution, as traffic may at times be reduced to a single lane. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
